    "summary": "When your opponent's turn ends, you may move some of your **HERETIC ASTARTES TERMINATOR**, **OBLITERATORS** and **MUTILATORS** units off the battlefield into **[Strategic Reserves](vsdata:core-rule/strategic-reserves)**, skipping any unit within **Engagement Range** of an enemy unit. How many depends on battle size:\n\n- Incursion: 1 unit at most.\n- Strike Force: 2 units at most.\n- Onslaught: 3 units at most.",
